OL,3,GNEWSACity's big buildings roped into
OL,4,Arescue contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sight of multiple high-rise rescues
OL,7,Fin Nottingham is not a cause for alarm
OL,8,F- but rather a competition in full
OL,9,Fswing, the fire service has said.
OL,11,FThe city is welcoming fire and rescue
OL,12,Fteams from across the UK and Portugal
OL,13,Fas it hosts the United Kingdom Rescue
OL,14,FOrganisation (UKRO) National Rope
OL,15,FRescue Challenge.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
