OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1790934939
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACity's big buildings roped into
OL,4,Arescue contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday the contest began at the
OL,7,FNational Ice Arena and on Friday teams
OL,8,Fwill take on eight different rope
OL,9,Frescue scenarios across the city, with
OL,10,Fvenues including the Theatre Royal,
OL,11,FWilford Suspension Bridge and Notts
OL,12,FCounty's Meadow Lane ground.
OL,14,FThe fire service asked the public not
OL,15,Fto be concerned, saying "these will be
OL,16,Fplanned competition scenarios and not
OL,17,Freal-life emergencies".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
